flowchart LR

    %% Implemented in lib/placement-flow.ts (transitionPlacement).
    %% "attempt" counts drops of the current item across every branch; MAX = 2.

    A[Dragging current item] --> REV{Correct step already told?}

    %% =========================
    %% AFTER THE REVEAL
    %% =========================

    REV -->|Yes| RB{Correct placement?}
    RB -->|Yes| RC[Professor: That's the one — good]
    RC --> R[Item resolved]
    RB -->|No| RD[Professor: That's step N — drag it to step M]
    RD --> A

    %% =========================
    %% EVERY OTHER DROP (right or wrong, always asked)
    %% =========================

    REV -->|No| CH{Correct placement?}
    CH -->|Yes, 80%| R
    CH -->|Otherwise| T[Lock item]
    T --> U[Professor asks: Are you sure?]
    U --> V{TA response — LLM classifies}

    V -->|Unclear, 1st time| CL[Professor: Just to check — are you keeping it there?]
    CL --> V
    V -->|Unclear, 2nd time| NO

    V -->|Yes| B{Correct placement?}

    B -->|Yes| K[Professor gives brief affirmation + explanation]
    K --> R

    B -->|No| AB[Professor asks: Why do you think this is the right place?]
    AB --> AC[TA explains]
    AC --> AD[Professor: Consider this: relevant concept / criterion]
    AD --> AE[TA responds]
    AE --> AT

    V -->|No| NO{Correct placement?}
    NO -->|Yes| M[Professor asks: What about your placement are you unsure about?]
    NO -->|No| W[Professor asks: Then what do you think is not right, and why?]
    M --> N[TA responds]
    W --> N
    N --> AT

    %% =========================
    %% SHARED ATTEMPT CHECK
    %% =========================

    AT{Attempt < 2?}
    AT -->|Yes| Z[Professor: Take another look — drag it where it fits best<br/>Unlock item]
    Z --> A
    AT -->|No| AA[Professor tells the correct step + explanation<br/>Unlock item — TA must move it]
    AA --> A

    %% =========================
    %% RESOLUTION RULE
    %% =========================

    R --> NEXT[Proceed to pass/fail marking]

    %% Current item must resolve before NEXT is reached
